OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused's attack was
OL,4,A'cowardly', trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub owner who was killed by a punch
OL,7,Fto the neck was "quietly and cowardly
OL,8,Fattacked from behind" by a man with a
OL,9,F"fist like a sledgehammer", a trial has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FBilly Allison, 36, denies murdering
OL,13,F44-year-old Matthew O'Gara at the Ricco
OL,14,Fand Loren bar in Lichfield on 24 May,
OL,15,Fbut has admitted manslaughter.
OL,17,FProsecutors told Stafford Crown Court
OL,18,Fthe defendant, who has previously taken
OL,19,Fpart in boxing matches, deliberately
OL,20,Fwaited for O'Gara to turn his back so
OL,21,Fhe could strike at a "vulnerable area".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
