OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused's attack was
OL,4,A'cowardly', trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllison, of Shirley, Solihull, also
OL,7,Fadmitted inflicting grievous bodily
OL,8,Fharm against O'Gara's friend Adam
OL,9,FCooper during the same incident but
OL,10,Fdenies section 18 grievous bodily harm
OL,11,Fwith intent.
